Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 08:06:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Find SVG exports of layers with user names

kicad-cli --mode-multi names each SVG after the layer's user name, so a
board whose layer table has (0 "F.Cu" signal "Front") produces
board-Front.svg instead of board-F_Cu.svg, and plotting fails with
"kicad-cli did not produce an unambiguous SVG for layer F.Cu".

Read the user names from the board's layer table and derive the file
name suffix the way kicad-cli does.
